# Task - Ontology: Finite Automaton Analysis

Analyze this finite automaton. How would one go about formalizing its regular lanaguage? How would it be classified in terms of the automata discussed? Are there any general theorems that can be applied to the automaton to deduce its properties? 

I am concerned about the consistency of the automata, as its propositional capacity is quite rich. Sprites are complex data structures, and the assertions being made of them in the automata conditions are hard to analyze from the perspective of "stable" automata loops.


